{
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "strings": {
    "A Calmer Way to Set Tiles": {
      "comment": "Title of the tip at the More menu of the painting screen about Zen Mode",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ruhiger Steinchen setzen"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Una forma más tranquila de colocar teselas"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Une façon plus calme de poser les tesselles"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un modo più calmo di posare le tessere"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "もっと穏やかにタイルをはめるには"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "더 차분하게 타일을 붙이는 방법"
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rustiger steentjes leggen"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Um jeito mais calmo de assentar pastilhas"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "更从容的镶嵌方式"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "更平靜的鑲嵌方式"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A free mosaic comes back each day, up to five, and Paint by Moonlight’s new paintings take from the same five. Mosaics someone sends you are always free.": {
      "comment": "Footer of Settings › Unlimited Paintings before the purchase is bought: how free mosaics work (every new mosaic takes one, from the count Paint by Moonlight's new paintings share; mosaics someone sends never need one)",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Jeden Tag kommt ein kostenloses Mosaik zurück, bis zu fünf, und neue Bilder von Paint by Moonlight nehmen sich von denselben fünf. Mosaike, die dir jemand schickt, sind immer kostenlos."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cada día vuelve un mosaico gratis, hasta cinco, y los cuadros nuevos de Paint by Moonlight salen de esos mismos cinco. Los mosaicos que alguien te envía son siempre gratis."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Une mosaïque gratuite revient chaque jour, jusqu’à cinq, et les nouveaux tableaux de Paint by Moonlight puisent dans les mêmes cinq. Les mosaïques qu’on vous envoie sont toujours gratuites."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ogni giorno torna un mosaico gratuito, fino a cinque, e i nuovi quadri di Paint by Moonlight attingono dagli stessi cinque. I mosaici che qualcuno ti invia sono sempre gratuiti."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "無料のモザイクは1日に1枚ずつ、5枚まで戻ってきます。Paint by Moonlightの新しい絵も、同じ5枚から使います。誰かから送られたモザイクはいつでも無料です。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "무료 모자이크는 하루에 하나씩 다시 생겨 최대 다섯 개까지 모이고, Paint by Moonlight의 새 그림도 같은 다섯 개에서 쓰여요. 누군가 보내 준 모자이크는 언제나 무료예요."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Elke dag komt er een gratis mozaïek terug, tot vijf, en de nieuwe schilderijen van Paint by Moonlight nemen uit dezelfde vijf. Mozaïeken die iemand je stuurt zijn altijd gratis."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Um mosaico gratuito volta a cada dia, até cinco, e as pinturas novas do Paint by Moonlight usam os mesmos cinco. Os mosaicos que alguém envia para você são sempre gratuitos."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每天恢复一次免费马赛克，最多五次，Paint by Moonlight 的新画作也从这五次里扣。别人发给你的马赛克始终免费。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每天會補回一幅免費馬賽克，最多五幅，而 Paint by Moonlight 的新畫作也是從這五幅中扣除。別人傳給你的馬賽克永遠免費。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
