    "Send goes straight to the people who make Paint by Moonlight.": {
      "comment": "Feedback's review sheet: footer under what is sent; Send delivers the feedback to the developers directly",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "„Senden“ geht direkt an die Menschen, die Paint by Mosaic machen."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Send goes straight to the people who make Paint by Mosaic."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Enviar llega directamente a las personas que hacen Paint by Mosaic."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Envoyer va directement aux personnes qui font Paint by Mosaic."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Invia arriva direttamente alle persone che creano Paint by Mosaic."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「送信」で、Paint by Mosaicを作っている人たちに直接届きます。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "보내기를 누르면 Paint by Mosaic을 만드는 사람들에게 바로 전해져요."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Stuur gaat rechtstreeks naar de mensen die Paint by Mosaic maken."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Enviar vai direto para as pessoas que fazem o Paint by Mosaic."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“发送”会直接送到制作 Paint by Mosaic 的人手中。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「傳送」會直接送到製作 Paint by Mosaic 的人手上。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Send goes straight to the people who make Paint by Moonlight. Your photo helps us remake the painting; it goes only if you turn it on.": {
      "comment": "Feedback's review sheet: footer under what is sent, for a painting made from the painter's own photo",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "„Senden“ geht direkt an die Menschen, die Paint by Mosaic machen. Dein Foto hilft uns, das Mosaik neu zu legen; es wird nur mitgeschickt, wenn du es einschaltest."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Send goes straight to the people who make Paint by Mosaic. Your photo helps us lay the mosaic again; it goes only if you turn it on."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Enviar llega directamente a las personas que hacen Paint by Mosaic. Tu foto nos ayuda a volver a componer el mosaico; solo se envía si la activas."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Envoyer va directement aux personnes qui font Paint by Mosaic. Votre photo nous aide à recomposer la mosaïque ; elle n’est envoyée que si vous l’activez."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Invia arriva direttamente alle persone che creano Paint by Mosaic. La tua foto ci aiuta a ricomporre il mosaico; viene inviata solo se la attivi."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「送信」で、Paint by Mosaicを作っている人たちに直接届きます。写真はモザイクを組み直すのに役立ちます。写真はオンにしたときだけ送られます。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "보내기를 누르면 Paint by Mosaic을 만드는 사람들에게 바로 전해져요. 사진은 모자이크를 다시 만들어 보는 데 도움이 되고, 켤 때만 함께 가요."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Stuur gaat rechtstreeks naar de mensen die Paint by Mosaic maken. Met je foto kunnen we het mozaïek opnieuw leggen; hij gaat alleen mee als je hem aanzet."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Enviar vai direto para as pessoas que fazem o Paint by Mosaic. Sua foto nos ajuda a assentar o mosaico de novo; ela só vai se você ativar."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“发送”会直接送到制作 Paint by Mosaic 的人手中。你的照片能帮我们重新镶嵌这幅马赛克；只有你打开它，才会一起发送。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「傳送」會直接送到製作 Paint by Mosaic 的人手上。你的照片能幫助我們重新鋪排這幅馬賽克；只有在你打開時才會一起送出。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
