    "Your photos and mosaics stay on this device unless you share them or choose to send feedback. Paint by Mosaic has no accounts, ads or tracking.": {
      "comment": "Footer of the About section in Settings: the privacy statement",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Deine Fotos und Mosaike bleiben auf diesem Gerät, außer du teilst sie oder schickst uns Feedback. Paint by Mosaic hat keine Accounts, keine Werbung und kein Tracking."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tus fotos y mosaicos se quedan en este dispositivo, salvo que los compartas o decidas enviar comentarios. Paint by Mosaic no tiene cuentas, anuncios ni rastreo."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vos photos et vos mosaïques restent sur cet appareil, sauf si vous les partagez ou choisissez d’envoyer des commentaires. Paint by Mosaic n’a ni compte, ni publicité, ni suivi."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le tue foto e i tuoi mosaici restano su questo dispositivo, a meno che tu non li condivida o scelga di inviare un feedback. Paint by Mosaic non ha account, pubblicità né tracciamento."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "写真やモザイクは、共有したりフィードバックを送ったりしないかぎり、このデバイスに残ります。Paint by Mosaicにはアカウントも広告もトラッキングもありません。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "사진과 모자이크는 직접 공유하거나 피드백을 보내기로 하지 않는 한 이 기기에만 머물러요. Paint by Mosaic에는 계정도, 광고도, 추적도 없어요."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je foto’s en mozaïeken blijven op dit apparaat, tenzij je ze deelt of ervoor kiest feedback te sturen. Paint by Mosaic heeft geen accounts, advertenties of tracking."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Suas fotos e mosaicos ficam neste aparelho, a menos que você os compartilhe ou escolha enviar feedback. O Paint by Mosaic não tem contas, anúncios nem rastreamento."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "除非你分享它们或选择发送反馈，你的照片和马赛克都只保留在这台设备上。Paint by Mosaic 没有账户、广告或跟踪。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "除非你分享或選擇傳送意見回饋，否則你的照片和馬賽克都會留在這部裝置上。Paint by Mosaic 沒有帳號、廣告或追蹤。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "acknowledgements.codeFooter": {
      "comment": "Footer under the Open-Source Code list in Acknowledgements",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Swift-Portierungen dieser Bibliotheken sind Teil der Vorlagen-Engine."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Swift ports of these libraries are part of the template engine."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Las versiones en Swift de estas bibliotecas forman parte del motor de plantillas."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Des portages en Swift de ces bibliothèques font partie du moteur de modèles."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le versioni in Swift di queste librerie fanno parte del motore dei modelli."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "これらのライブラリをSwiftに移植したものが、下絵エンジンの一部になっています。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "이 라이브러리들을 Swift로 옮긴 코드가 도안 엔진의 일부예요."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Swift-versies van deze bibliotheken maken deel uit van de sjabloonmaker."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Versões em Swift destas bibliotecas fazem parte do gerador de modelos."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这些库的 Swift 移植版是底稿引擎的一部分。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這些程式庫的 Swift 移植版本是底稿引擎的一部分。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "acknowledgements.distanceTransforms.usage": {
      "comment": "What a credited third-party method or library is used for in the template engine (Distance transforms); shown in Settings under Acknowledgements",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Misst, wie breit jede Region ist, damit jede Fläche groß genug zum Malen ist."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Measures how thick each region is, so every area is big enough to paint."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mide el grosor de cada región, para que todas las zonas sean lo bastante grandes para pintarlas."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mesure l’épaisseur de chaque région, pour que chaque zone soit assez grande pour être peinte."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Misura lo spessore di ogni regione, così ogni area è grande abbastanza da dipingere."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "各領域の太さを測り、どのエリアも塗れる大きさにします。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "영역마다 두께를 재서, 모든 영역이 칠하기에 충분히 크도록 해요."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Meet hoe dik elk gebied is, zodat elk vlak groot genoeg is om te schilderen."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mede a espessura de cada região, para que toda área seja grande o bastante para pintar."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "测量每个区域有多厚，让每个区域都大到可以涂色。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "測量每個區域有多厚，讓每個區塊都大到足以上色。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "acknowledgements.domainTransform.usage": {
      "comment": "What a credited third-party method or library is used for in the template engine (Domain transform); shown in Settings under Acknowledgements",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Glättet Textur zu malerischen Flecken und hält Konturen scharf."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Smooths texture into painterly patches while keeping contours sharp."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Suaviza la textura en manchas pictóricas sin perder la nitidez de los contornos."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lisse la texture en touches picturales tout en gardant les contours nets."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Trasforma le texture in macchie pittoriche mantenendo nitidi i contorni."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "輪郭はくっきり保ったまま、質感を絵画のような色面になめらかにします。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "윤곽은 선명하게 두고 질감을 그림 같은 면으로 부드럽게 만들어요."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Strijkt textuur glad tot schilderachtige vlekken, terwijl contouren scherp blijven."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Suaviza a textura em manchas de pintura, mantendo os contornos nítidos."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "把纹理平滑成如画的色块，同时保持轮廓清晰。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "把紋理柔化成有繪畫感的色塊，同時保持輪廓清晰。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "acknowledgements.douglasPeucker.usage": {
      "comment": "What a credited third-party method or library is used for in the template engine (Douglas-Peucker); shown in Settings under Acknowledgements",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Entfernt Kurvenpunkte, die die Form nicht verändern."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Thins out curve points that do not change the shape."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Elimina los puntos de una curva que no cambian su forma."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Retire les points d’une courbe qui ne changent pas sa forme."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Riduce i punti di una curva che non ne cambiano la forma."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "形を変えない曲線上の点を間引きます。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "모양을 바꾸지 않는 곡선의 점을 덜어 내요."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dunt punten op een kromme uit die de vorm niet veranderen."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Elimina pontos de curva que não mudam a forma."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "精简不影响形状的曲线点。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "刪去不會改變形狀的曲線點。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "acknowledgements.earcut.usage": {
      "comment": "What a credited third-party method or library is used for in the template engine (Earcut); shown in Settings under Acknowledgements",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Zerlegt den Umriss jeder Region in Dreiecke für das Netz, das die Leinwand malt."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Triangulates each region’s outline into the mesh the canvas paints."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Triangula el contorno de cada región en la malla que pinta el lienzo."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Découpe le contour de chaque région en triangles, le maillage que la toile peint."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Scompone il contorno di ogni regione nei triangoli che la tela dipinge."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "各領域の輪郭を、キャンバスが塗る三角形のメッシュに分割します。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "영역마다 윤곽을 캔버스가 칠하는 삼각형 메시로 나눠요."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Deelt de omtrek van elk gebied op in driehoeken voor het net dat het canvas schildert."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Triangula o contorno de cada região na malha que a tela pinta."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "把每个区域的轮廓剖分成画布用来涂色的三角网格。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "把每個區域的輪廓切分成三角形，組成畫布繪製的網格。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "acknowledgements.faceLandmarks.usage": {
      "comment": "What a credited third-party method or library is used for in Ravenna's mosaic engine (face landmarks); shown in Settings under Acknowledgements",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Findet Augen, Brauen, Nase und Lippen eines Gesichts, die zuerst gesetzt werden, als eigene Stücke."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Finds a face’s eyes, brows, nose and lips, which are set first, as pieces of their own."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Encuentra los ojos, las cejas, la nariz y los labios de una cara, que se colocan primero, como piezas propias."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Trouve les yeux, les sourcils, le nez et les lèvres d’un visage, posés en premier, en pièces à part."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Trova occhi, sopracciglia, naso e labbra di un volto, che vengono posati per primi, come pezzi a sé."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "顔の目、眉、鼻、唇を見つけます。これらは専用のピースとして最初に置かれます。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "얼굴의 눈, 눈썹, 코, 입술을 찾아 각각 따로 된 조각으로 가장 먼저 붙여요."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vindt de ogen, wenkbrauwen, neus en lippen van een gezicht, die eerst worden gelegd, als eigen stukken."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Encontra os olhos, as sobrancelhas, o nariz e os lábios de um rosto, que são assentados primeiro, como peças próprias."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "找出面部的眼睛、眉毛、鼻子和嘴唇，它们会作为单独的部分最先镶嵌。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "找出臉部的眼睛、眉毛、鼻子和嘴唇，它們會最先鋪設，各自成為獨立的一塊。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "acknowledgements.hed.usage": {
      "comment": "What a credited third-party method or library is used for in the template engine (Holistically-nested edge detection); shown in Settings under Acknowledgements",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fügt Kanten aus fünf Maßstäben zu einer Karte der Linien eines Fotos zusammen."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Combines edges found at five scales into one map of a photo’s lines."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Combina bordes hallados a cinco escalas en un solo mapa de las líneas de una foto."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Combine des contours trouvés à cinq échelles en une seule carte des traits d’une photo."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Combina i bordi trovati a cinque scale in un’unica mappa delle linee di una foto."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "5つのスケールで見つけたエッジを、写真の線のひとつのマップにまとめます。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "다섯 가지 크기에서 찾은 가장자리를 합쳐 사진의 선을 담은 지도 하나로 만들어요."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Voegt randen die op vijf schalen gevonden zijn samen tot één kaart van de lijnen in een foto."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Combina bordas encontradas em cinco escalas num único mapa das linhas da foto."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "把在五种尺度上找到的边缘合成一张照片线条图。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "把在五種尺度下找到的邊緣，結合成一張照片線條圖。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "acknowledgements.hedModel.mosaic.usage": {
      "comment": "What a credited machine-learning model is used for (ControlNet's HED edge detector) in Ravenna; shown in Settings under Acknowledgements",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Findet die Umrisse eines Fotos, denen die Steinchenreihen des Mosaiks folgen."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Finds the outlines of a photo, which the mosaic’s strands of tiles follow."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Encuentra los contornos de una foto, que siguen las hileras de teselas del mosaico."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Trouve les contours d’une photo, que suivent les rangs de tesselles de la mosaïque."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Trova i contorni di una foto, che le file di tessere del mosaico seguono."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "写真の輪郭を見つけます。モザイクのタイルの列はそれに沿って並びます。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "사진의 윤곽을 찾아요. 모자이크의 타일 줄이 그 윤곽을 따라가요."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vindt de omtrekken in een foto, die de rijen steentjes van het mozaïek volgen."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Encontra os contornos de uma foto, que os fios de pastilhas do mosaico seguem."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "找出照片的轮廓，马赛克的一串串嵌片沿着它铺设。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "找出照片的輪廓，讓馬賽克一排排的嵌片沿著它們排列。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "acknowledgements.kmeans.usage": {
      "comment": "What a credited third-party method or library is used for in the template engine (k-means++); shown in Settings under Acknowledgements",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wählt gut verteilte Startfarben für die Palette."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Picks well-spread starting colors for the palette."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Elige colores iniciales bien repartidos para la paleta."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Choisit des couleurs de départ bien réparties pour la palette."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sceglie colori di partenza ben distribuiti per la tavolozza."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "パレットの最初の色を、ほどよくばらけるように選びます。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "팔레트의 시작 색을 고르게 퍼지도록 골라요."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kiest goed gespreide beginkleuren voor het palet."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Escolhe cores iniciais bem distribuídas para a paleta."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "为调色板挑选分布均匀的初始颜色。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "為調色盤挑選分布均勻的起始顏色。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
