    "Check your connection and try again, or share it another way. What you wrote is kept.": {
      "comment": "Message of the alert when the feedback couldn't be sent; its buttons are Try Again, Share Instead and Cancel, and Cancel keeps the painter's note and marks",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Prüfe deine Verbindung und versuch es noch einmal oder teile es auf anderem Weg. Was du geschrieben hast, bleibt erhalten."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Comprueba tu conexión y vuelve a intentarlo, o compártelo de otra forma. Lo que escribiste se conserva."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vérifiez votre connexion et réessayez, ou partagez autrement. Ce que vous avez écrit est conservé."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Controlla la connessione e riprova, o condividilo in un altro modo. Ciò che hai scritto è conservato."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "接続を確認してもう一度試すか、別の方法で共有してください。書いた内容は残っています。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "연결 상태를 확인하고 다시 시도하거나, 다른 방법으로 공유해 주세요. 쓴 내용은 남아 있어요."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Controleer je verbinding en probeer het opnieuw, of deel het op een andere manier. Wat je schreef, blijft bewaard."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Verifique a sua conexão e tente de novo, ou compartilhe de outro jeito. O que você escreveu fica guardado."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请检查网络连接后再试一次，或者换一种方式分享。你写的内容会保留。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "請檢查網路連線後再試一次，或改用其他方式分享。你寫的內容會保留。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
