    "Hold Show Photo to see the original. Tap it to keep it showing.": {
      "comment": "Message of the tip titled Peek at the Photo, about the painting screen’s Photo control, which shows the photo the painting was made from",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Halte „Foto zeigen“ gedrückt, um das Original zu sehen. Tippe darauf, damit es sichtbar bleibt."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mantén pulsado Mostrar foto para ver el original. Tócalo para que siga visible."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Maintenez Afficher la photo pour voir l’original. Touchez-le pour la garder affichée."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tieni premuto Mostra foto per vedere l’originale. Toccalo per lasciarla visibile."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「写真を表示」を押し続けると元の写真が見えます。タップすると表示したままになります。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "사진 보기를 길게 누르면 원본이 보여요. 탭하면 계속 보여요."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Houd Toon foto vast om het origineel te zien. Tik erop om de foto te laten staan."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mantenha Mostrar foto pressionado para ver o original. Toque para deixar à mostra."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按住“显示照片”可以查看原图。轻点它可让照片保持显示。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按住「顯示照片」可以看原圖。點一下則會讓它持續顯示。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In More, Give Feedback lets you mark the mosaic and say what is wrong or right.": {
      "comment": "Message of the tip titled Tell Us What You Think; More is the painting screen’s menu button, Give Feedback one of its items",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Unter „Mehr“ kannst du mit „Feedback geben“ das Mosaik markieren und sagen, was nicht stimmt oder was gut ist."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "En Más, Enviar comentarios te permite marcar el mosaico y decir qué está mal o qué está bien."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dans Plus, Envoyer des commentaires vous permet d’annoter la mosaïque et de dire ce qui va ou ne va pas."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In Altro, Invia feedback ti permette di segnare il mosaico e dire cosa non va o cosa funziona."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「その他」の「フィードバックを送る」で、モザイクに印をつけて、よくない所やよい所を伝えられます。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "더 보기의 피드백 보내기에서 모자이크에 표시하고 무엇이 좋고 아쉬운지 말해 줄 수 있어요."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In Meer kun je met Geef feedback het mozaïek markeren en zeggen wat er mis of goed is."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Em Mais, Dar feedback permite marcar o mosaico e dizer o que está errado ou certo."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在“更多”中，“提供反馈”让你可以在马赛克上做标记，说说哪里不好、哪里不错。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在「更多」中，「提供意見回饋」可讓你在馬賽克上做記號，說說哪裡不對、哪裡很好。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In More, Zen Mode moves the mosaic to the next tile after each one you set.": {
      "comment": "Message of the tip titled A Calmer Way to Paint; More is the painting screen’s menu button, Zen Mode one of its items",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Unter „Mehr“ führt dich der Zen-Modus nach jedem gesetzten Steinchen zum nächsten."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "En Más, Modo Zen lleva el mosaico a la siguiente tesela después de cada una que colocas."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dans Plus, le mode zen amène la mosaïque à la tesselle suivante après chaque tesselle posée."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In Altro, la Modalità Zen porta il mosaico alla tessera successiva dopo ogni tessera posata."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「その他」の「禅モード」をオンにすると、タイルをはめるたびに次のタイルへ移動します。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "더 보기의 젠 모드는 타일을 하나 붙일 때마다 다음 타일로 모자이크를 옮겨 줘요."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In Meer schuift Zen-modus het mozaïek na elk steentje dat je legt naar het volgende."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Em Mais, o Modo Zen leva o mosaico para a próxima pastilha depois de cada uma que você assenta."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在“更多”中，“禅模式”会在你每镶好一块后，把马赛克移到下一块嵌片。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在「更多」中，「禪模式」會在你每鑲好一片嵌片後，把馬賽克移到下一片。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
