    "Music plays the tune as each tile goes in: in a major key, a minor one, or by the hour.": {
      "comment": "Message of the tip titled Worth a Look Here, at the Painting Length setting; the Making-of is a setting that plays a show after Start Painting",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die Musik spielt die Melodie, während jedes Steinchen gesetzt wird: in Dur, in Moll oder je nach Uhrzeit."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Música toca la melodía a medida que entra cada tesela: en tono mayor, en menor o según la hora."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Musique joue la mélodie à chaque tesselle posée : en mode majeur, en mode mineur, ou selon l’heure."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Musica suona la melodia mentre ogni tessera va al suo posto: in tonalità maggiore, minore, o secondo l’ora."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「音楽」は、タイルをはめるたびにメロディを奏でます。長調、短調、または時刻に合わせて選べます。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "음악은 타일을 하나 붙일 때마다 선율을 연주해요. 장조, 단조, 또는 시간에 따라 바뀌어요."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Muziek speelt de melodie terwijl elk steentje erin gaat: in majeur, in mineur, of naar het uur."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Música toca a melodia conforme cada pastilha entra: em tom maior, em tom menor, ou conforme a hora."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“音乐”会在每块嵌片镶上时奏出旋律：大调、小调，或按时辰而定。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「音樂」會在每片嵌片鑲上時奏出旋律：大調、小調，或依時辰而定。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
