    "Watch the preview change. Reset to Suggested returns every slider to where it started.": {
      "comment": "Message of the tip titled You Can Always Go Back; Reset to Suggested is the New Painting button that returns the sliders to the suggested settings",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sieh zu, wie sich die Vorschau ändert. „Auf Vorschlag zurücksetzen“ bringt jeden Regler an seinen Anfang zurück."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mira cómo cambia la vista previa. Volver a lo sugerido devuelve cada regulador a donde empezó."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Regardez l’aperçu changer. Revenir aux suggestions remet chaque curseur à son point de départ."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Guarda l’anteprima cambiare. Reimposta suggerite riporta ogni cursore dov’era all’inizio."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "プレビューの変化を見てみましょう。「おすすめに戻す」で、すべてのスライダが最初の位置に戻ります。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "미리보기가 바뀌는 걸 지켜보세요. 추천 설정으로 재설정을 누르면 모든 슬라이더가 처음 자리로 돌아가요."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kijk hoe de voorvertoning verandert. Terug naar voorgesteld zet elke schuifknop terug waar hij begon."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Veja a prévia mudar. Voltar ao sugerido devolve cada controle ao ponto de partida."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "看看预览怎样变化。“恢复建议设置”会让每个滑块回到最初的位置。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "看著預覽改變。「重置為建議設定」會讓每個滑桿回到原來的位置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
